spell.core.mirth.description.advanced:
{Advanced Mirth}

Increases {Morale} of the {target allied unit} by {+2}.

{While Mirth lasts}, Morale penalties cannot reduce that unit below {+2 Morale}.

spell.core.mirth.description.basic:
{Basic Mirth}

Increases {Morale} of the {target allied unit} by {+1}.

{While Mirth lasts}, Morale penalties cannot reduce that unit below {+1 Morale}.

spell.core.mirth.description.expert:
{Expert Mirth}

Increases {Morale} of {all allied units} by {+2}.

{While Mirth lasts}, Morale penalties cannot reduce affected units below {+2 Morale}.

spell.core.mirth.description.none:
{Mirth}

Increases {Morale} of the {target allied unit} by {+1}.

{While Mirth lasts}, Morale penalties cannot reduce that unit below {+1 Morale}.

spell.core.sorrow.description.advanced:
{Advanced Sorrow}

Decreases {Morale} of the {target enemy unit} by {-2}.

{While Sorrow lasts}, Morale bonuses cannot raise that unit above {-2 Morale}.

spell.core.sorrow.description.basic:
{Basic Sorrow}

Decreases {Morale} of the {target enemy unit} by {-1}.

{While Sorrow lasts}, Morale bonuses cannot raise that unit above {-1 Morale}.

spell.core.sorrow.description.expert:
{Expert Sorrow}

Decreases {Morale} of {all enemy units} by {-2}.

{While Sorrow lasts}, Morale bonuses cannot raise affected units above {-2 Morale}.

spell.core.sorrow.description.none:
{Sorrow}

Decreases {Morale} of the {target enemy unit} by {-1}.

{While Sorrow lasts}, Morale bonuses cannot raise that unit above {-1 Morale}.
